# TOOL-B02 starter.flags — the warning part of the team's CFLAGS today.
# One flag (or flag + argument) per line; '#' starts a comment.
# check.sh compiles bugs12.c with these flags (every BUGnn line must get a
# diagnostic) and good.c with these flags + -Werror (must be silent).
# TODO: grow this into the project baseline.  Rules: no -w, no -Weverything,
#       no -Wno-error; every flag must also work on gcc / arm-none-eabi-gcc;
#       do not edit bugs12.c, good.c or third_party/.
-Wall
-I third_party
